  "label": "Performance art",
  "description": "An art form that uses live actions, often theatrical or exaggerated, to convey a message or emotion. Drag performance is a form of performance art that often involves theatricality and exaggeration. The drag performer’s confident expression and bold appearance are part of a performance, which contrasts with the internal struggle described in the text, making this concept essential to understanding the meme’s message.",
